# UX Copy

The interface is a **music distribution / direct-to-fan** product. Spanish copy must feel premium and clear to artists and fans.

## Principles

- Prefer concise language over full sentences
- Speak publish / sell / monetize — not protocol / SDK / chain
- Prefer title case for short CTAs and section labels in Spanish when they match product phrases

## Prefer (es)

- Publicar Obra
- Artist Studio
- Comprar Licencia
- Abrir Marketplace
- Quiénes somos (solo tecnología)
- Soporte

## Avoid (es) in product surfaces

- Protocolo / SDK / Núcleo / Adaptador Blockchain
- Subir Canción
- Comprar NFT
- Wallet Address / Transaction Hash / Gas / RPC / Signer / Nonce
- Informal demo chatter (“Haz clic…”, “playground”)

## Tone check

If a string sounds like infrastructure marketing or a blockchain tutorial, move it to Who We Are — or rewrite for artists and fans.
